  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable ocean management in Africa through the Ocean Decade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build on the significant achievements obtained through previous support from Sweden. It is framed within the overall vision and mission of the UN Decade of Ocean Science for Sustainable Development, and is structured around the three following interrelated pillars:
&#x25cf;	Outcome 1: Support to implementation of the Ocean Decade in Africa 
&#x25cf;	Outcome 2: Strengthened marine spatial planning processes and regional governance mechanisms in Africa and Tropical Americas &amp; Caribbean Region
&#x25cf;	Outcome 3: Ocean Literacy 

Its primary objective is to facilitate the implementation of key elements of the Ocean Decade Africa Roadmap.</narrative>
  </description>
